ouch (0.8.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against action-debian-build v1.10.0, which restores
    reproducibility. Upstream's CHANGELOG, installed as changelog.gz, kept the
    checkout's mtime here while a rebuild from the .dsc took upstream's commit
    date from the orig tarball. dpkg-deb clamps only the newer of the two, so
    the two builds disagreed by one tar header.

